{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/capsule_main.png?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are 'trapped' in the Labyrinth of Oblivion. <br><br>A dungeon created by your memories and you gradually lose your skills. <br><br>Will you be able to clear this labyrinth?</strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main System :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you start the game, you become a very powerful 'hero'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/1_2.png?t=1744290964\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have all the skills from the beginning, so you can easily clear any adversity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, isn't the game too easy? Unfortunately, this labyrinth is not easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/losePowerScene_1920.png?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to advance, you have to dedicate your skills to the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, the labyrinth will create the appearance at the time when you obtained that skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can advance that much. However, the skills you dedicate in this way cannot be used in that play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In other words, the game becomes more difficult as you advance. I wonder how many skills you will have left when you reach the end of this labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To clear the space created by the labyrinth, you must clear various conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/battle.gif?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have to defeat enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/defend.gif?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have to protect something,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/mirror.gif?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry. As long as you have enough skills, you will clear it easily :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And... :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You headed to this labyrinth to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And a young friend is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/2_2.png?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't forget this fact!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to meet this friend again at the end of your adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634810?t=1744290964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634810?t=1744290964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/34acd3c16372d21338a8606d5b73dee6103598f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744290964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/34acd3c16372d21338a8606d5b73dee6103598f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744290964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The deaths of some characters are depicted."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/capsule_main.png?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are 'trapped' in the Labyrinth of Oblivion. <br><br>A dungeon created by your memories and you gradually lose your skills. <br><br>Will you be able to clear this labyrinth?</strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main System :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you start the game, you become a very powerful 'hero'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/1_2.png?t=1744290964\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have all the skills from the beginning, so you can easily clear any adversity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, isn't the game too easy? Unfortunately, this labyrinth is not easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/losePowerScene_1920.png?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to advance, you have to dedicate your skills to the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, the labyrinth will create the appearance at the time when you obtained that skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can advance that much. However, the skills you dedicate in this way cannot be used in that play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In other words, the game becomes more difficult as you advance. I wonder how many skills you will have left when you reach the end of this labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To clear the space created by the labyrinth, you must clear various conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/battle.gif?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have to defeat enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/defend.gif?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have to protect something,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/mirror.gif?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry. As long as you have enough skills, you will clear it easily :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And... :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You headed to this labyrinth to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And a young friend is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/2_2.png?t=1744290964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't forget this fact!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to meet this friend again at the end of your adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["SinPoDo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/7b36e8c307f861ec5a4da4ec3f533c0b071af7b2/header.jpg?t=1744290964","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Hero Like","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SS